<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-PetSec Energy yr net profit soars.</title>
<headline>RTRS-PetSec Energy yr net profit soars.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>		  (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    22.69 vs 8.06</p>
<p>    Net profit			    21.57 vs 6.76</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)			nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Abnormal items	     profit 22.19 vs profit 1.71</p>
<p>    Extraordinary items	loss    6.73 vs nil</p>
<p>    Tax				     13.86 vs 4.41</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    30.0 vs 8.0</p>
<p>    Net sales (US$)		     67.22 vs 30.88</p>
<p>NOTE: PetSec Energy Ltd was formerly known as Petroleum Securities Australia Ltd. The results are for calendar 1996 vs calendar 1995 and follow a change in the company's balance date from June 30.</p>
<p>The company is a petroleum producer with operations based in the Gulf of Mexico.</p>
<p>Abnormal items were partly from sale of investments.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
